# Helm templates contain Go template syntax that Prettier doesn't understand
**/templates/**

# CRD manifests are auto-generated by controller-gen and should not be reformatted
**/crds/**

# Minified/bundled assets should not be reformatted
**/dist/

# Generated public docs manifest: produced deterministically by
# projects/monolith/knowledge/tools/gen_docs_manifest.py (json.dumps indent=2)
# and freshness-checked in CI. Prettier reformatting it would diverge from the
# generator and churn the freshness check; the generator is the sole authority.
**/docs-manifest.json

# Generated ADR 036 orchestrator context bundle: produced deterministically by
# projects/monolith/knowledge/tools/gen_orchestrator_bundle.py and used as the
# byte-stable system prefix for provider prompt caching. Prettier would re-add
# blank lines before the digest lists and race the generator; the generator is
# the sole authority (same rationale as docs-manifest.json above).
**/chat/orchestrator_bundle.md

# STPA.md files are rendered deterministically by the stpa skill's jq renderer
# (.claude/skills/stpa). Reformatting would diverge from the renderer output and
# churn on every scheduled regeneration; the renderer is the sole authority.
**/STPA.md

# Git worktrees have their own formatting
.claude/worktrees/

# Vendored third-party docs (impeccable frontend-design references, Apache-2.0):
# kept byte-identical to upstream so the vendored copy stays verifiable. Baked
# into the goosecracker guest image at /opt/impeccable/.
**/vendor/impeccable/**
